# RESTORES -- player restores asked for through git (src/restores.c).
#
# One request per line:  <id> <player> <kind> <stamp> [<file>]
#
#   kind   gear    the snapshot's worn and carried objects, into inventory
#          stash   the snapshot's stash, added to what the stash holds
#          import  only install <file> as a snapshot, for staff to PRESTORE
#   stamp  the snapshot, by what follows "<Player>." in its name under
#          player/versions/<Player>/ -- 20261023_023244.death, or a unique
#          prefix of it.  With a <file>, a plain YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS naming it.
#   file   a player file from git history, put in area/restores/; boot
#          installs it as the snapshot <Player>.<stamp>.import.
#
# gear and stash apply at the player's next login, once (the id is kept
# in their file), and wait while their corpse still holds things.  Never
# reuse an id.  See wiki/player-backups.md.
